        "mythic"
      ],
      "text": "Trigger Runelord Belimarius reduces a mythic creature to 0 HP, or the PCs take more than 24 hours to confront her after securing entrance to the Eye of Desire\n\n---\nEffect The warshard Belimarius has fused with the Runewell of Lust flares with a sudden flash of blood-red light. Belimarius gains the mythic trait, 3 Mythic Points, and her Mythic Powers. In time, she might develop additional mythic powers, but only if she survives her encounter with the PCs.",
